texts, proposing a new nomenclature for the corpus. The study is founded upon a critical edition and an annotated working translation of the seven Chinese Christian texts dated between 635 and 1006.</note></biblStruct><bibl type="formatted" subtype="bibliography" resp="https://www.zotero.org/styles/chicago-note-bibliography-17th-edition">
